OL,3,GNEWSAThe boy without a voice - who's
OL,4,Ahelping others find theirs
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive-year-old Sohail Ahmed could see
OL,7,Fpeople waiting for him to speak. He
OL,8,Fcould hear the instructions inside his
OL,9,Fown head. But no words would come.
OL,11,F"Looking back, it's as though you're
OL,12,Fparalysed in some ways," he says.
OL,14,F"You're there, but you're not there.
OL,15,FYou're in the room, but you're not in
OL,16,Fthe room.
OL,18,F"Everybody's waiting for you to say
OL,19,Fsomething. You look at yourself from
OL,20,Fthat out-of-body experience and say 'go
OL,21,Fon, say something', but you don't, and
OL,22,Fyou can't."
